---
import { Badge } from "@/components/ui/badge";
---

<section class="w-full bg-background border-b border-border/80">
  <div
    class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 md:py-24 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
        <Badge
          variant="outline"
          className="text-muted-foreground text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider"
          >Aprende</Badge
        >
      </div>
      <h1
        class="font-display text-foreground text-4xl md:text-6xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight mb-6"
      >
        Recursos para builders
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-muted-foreground text-lg max-w-xl font-light leading-relaxed mb-6"
      >
        Guías y documentación para dar tus primeros pasos en Solidity y Vyper.
        Empieza por lo básico y avanza a tu ritmo.
      </p>
      <p
        class="text-muted-foreground text-sm max-w-xl font-light leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-primary/40 pl-4"
      >
        Esta página reúne materiales recomendados por la comunidad de Ethereum
        Bolivia para prepararte antes y durante Road To Buildathon.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative w-full min-h-[280px] md:min-h-[360px] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden ring-1 ring-border/60 bg-muted"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/builders-hackathon.jpg"
        alt="Builders colaborando en una hackathon"
        class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/75 via-black/25 to-transparent"
      >
      </div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-background/95 border border-border"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/15_isotipo_magenta.png"
            alt=""
            class="h-9 w-auto dark:hidden"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/16_isotipo_blanco.png"
            alt=""
            class="h-9 w-auto hidden dark:block"
          />
          <div>
            <p class="text-foreground font-semibold text-sm">
              Ethereum Bolivia
            </p>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-xs">
              Aprende · construye · comparte
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
